    esg:hasClimateLabel esgr:ClimateLabel_governance ;
    esg:recordText "The issuance of the report is also an effort of BeFa to comply with the provisions of Article 66 paragraph 2c, Law No. 40 of 2007 concerning Limited Liability Companies (Company Law), which requires companies to submit report on the implementation of Social and Environmental Responsibility in the Annual Report." ;
    esg:reasoning "The text describes compliance action with legal requirements for ESG reporting." ;
    esg:timestamp "2026-04-08T02:47:30.399111Z" ;
