    esg:hasClimateLabel esgr:ClimateLabel_strategy ;
    esg:hasClimateLabel esgr:ClimateLabel_opportunity ;
    esg:recordText "Throughout 2024, VKTR reinforced its strategic role in shaping a new landscape for sustainable transportation in Indonesia. No longer merely a pioneer, VKTR has emerged as a principal architect, designing and implementing adaptive and comprehensive green transport solutions. Through the development of commercial electric vehicles across various sectors, from trucks and buses to logistics and urban transport solutions, VKTR is introducing a new model of mobility that emphasizes both efficiency and a low-emission future." ;
    esg:reasoning "The text describes VKTR's strategic role in sustainable transportation, emphasizing green transport solutions and low-emission future, indicating a positive outcome in climate-related initiatives." ;
    esg:timestamp "2026-04-08T02:57:58.925003Z" ;
    esg:sourceTarget "vktr_ar_sr_2024_pdf/batch_21" ;
    esg:runIndex "80" ;
    esg:sentimentScore "0.8" .

