    esg:hasClimateLabel esgr:ClimateLabel_strategy ;
    esg:hasClimateLabel esgr:ClimateLabel_opportunity ;
    esg:recordText "The successful completion of VKTR's commercial electric vehicle assembly facility in Magelang marked a milestone in advancing national green industrialization. By prioritizing local standards and empowering domestic supply chains, VKTR has broadened the scope of its transformative impact, from technological advancement to the creation of economic and social value." ;
