    esg:recordText "VKTR continues to serve a vital role in the national effort toward a low-carbon transportation future. This journey goes beyond delivering products, it is about building a system, an ecosystem that responds to the demands of the times with technology, environmental responsibility, and a collective determination to shape a greener and more resilient Indonesia." ;
